   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-07):** the default avatar is the **monogram**: initials on a disc coloured from a stable hash of the pseudo. It is the same one as the MP list (#569 / PR #578), and it is drawn the same way in the reader: inline SVG, no request. The computation is trivial: a few characters hashed and one circle drawn. Cache it per pseudo if needed.\n\nOrder: #594 first (same `reader.js` click handler and `installMenuActions`). The Blacklist and Whitelist entries come with LOT-118 (#209).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
